Commit 87d9189. CLONE_SKIP sits in LibSSH.xs (XSUB in all 3 packages), because Channel.pm/SFTP.pm are never loaded. In a thread the var is an unblessed ref to an undef scalar (ref=SCALAR), not undef. Also found: t/11-threads.t checks only can('CLONE_SKIP') for Channel/SFTP (no live-object thread run); Channel.pm/SFTP.pm POD do not mention thread behaviour.
